# 默认：所有文本文件仓库内统一存 LF，检出也为 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Visual Studio 工程文件：按惯例保持 CRLF（工作区与检出一致，消除换行符警告）
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj text eol=crlf
*.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止任何换行符转换与 diff
*.tga binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.obj binary
*.pdb binary

# 作业输入文件：保持原始字节，不做任何转换
assignment0/inputs/* -text
